**Result: 46 of 46 as expected.** The three real proofs return true. All 43 mutations return false: a one-bit flip of the old root, of the new root, and of each proof element in turn; the proof reversed; the last element dropped; an element added; m+1; uppercase hex; and n+2^32, which is the int32 forge the file's own 08-12 self-audit describes.

